<title>USA: ECCS Inc files for share offering.</title>
<headline>ECCS Inc files for share offering.</headline>
<dateline>TINTON FALLS, N.J. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>ECCS Inc on Wednesday said it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 2,281,375 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it would issue and sell 2,157,207 shares and that certain stockholders will sell 124,168 shares.</p>
<p>ECCS, which supplies high-performance storage controllers and related products for open computer systems, said it would use proceeds to pay accrued preferred stock dividends and for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
